    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Loosely woven wool or cotton tabby, finished with a long nap to imitate felt and dyed in solid colors. Used as a protective covering for furnishings, as well as for costume, especially the lining of outerwear. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
